It uses the `os` module to collect file metadata and permissions.

An `AugmentedFileBrowser` class handles user interaction while `FileBrowser` handles the actual data collection and display.

The `display_perms` method displays the metadata of a single file, while the `display_tree` method displays the file system tree with metadata.

The `AugmentedFileBrowser` class provides a simple user interface to interact with the file browser.

